  "user_request": "The Physics department just announced (Monday 07:30) that my mandatory Advanced Physics Final Exam is scheduled for Wednesday 13th from 16:00 to 18:00 on campus. Since exams take priority over regular training, I cannot attend the 16:30 afternoon technical training on Wednesday (plus I need 30 minutes transit after the exam). My coach said I can make up that session individually on Wednesday evening from 19:00 to 20:30, or add an extra conditioning block on Friday afternoon from 14:00 to 15:30. Also, I need at least 6 hours of Physics study across Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday morning before the exam. Please reorganize my 5-day schedule, protect my 8 hours of sleep every night, and tell me what needs confirmation with my coach or friends."
}
